  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support for Publication: The John and The Paul in John Paul II</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This grant is aimed at providing a one-off package of assistance to support the Publication of a Book/Drama title &#x2018;&#x2018;The John and The Paul in John Paul II&#x2019;&#x2019; in commemoration of John Paul II Beatification Day by the Catholic Secretariat of Nigeria. 

The main component is financial support to offset the following cost;
 
I.	printing of 12,000 copies of &#x2018;&#x2018;The John and The Paul in John Paul II&#x2019;&#x2019;
II.	Narrator/Directors Fee</narrative>
  </description>
